{
  "description": "Add observed error responses to operations whose spec only declared 200. Verified via real API requests against api.erebor.bank: every GET-by-id returns 404 NOT_FOUND for valid-format unknown IDs and 400 INVALID_REQUEST for malformed IDs; every PATCH-by-id also returns 400/404; create endpoints return 400 for validation failures and 404 when a referenced resource (counterparty, deposit_account, etc.) does not exist; action endpoints (close, archive, ping, attribute) return 404 when the parent resource is missing.",
